    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e2318f3b41694aebb52b293af3e1161f",
      "statement": "app-ci's app-e2e job is gated behind a dorny paths-filter `changes` job scoped to paths that affect app runtime behaviour, so a PR touching only scripts/docs/openwiki renders app-e2e `skipped -> satisfied` and the board goes green without the E2E suite ever executing, making the suite's true failure rate invisible from an all-green streak.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.forgejo/workflows/app-ci.yml#L100-L175",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:618420a5844746266a6601b1038a34583446dc343c5c877aee61372e9d51bce3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_264609532be64fb3a0c47709b96a67ee",
      "statement": "cd-dispatch-gate.mjs (run by app-ci's advisory trigger-cd job) imports scripts/ci-status.mjs to reuse its cancelled/superseded/skipped classification, and that job runs node directly with no pnpm install step and no node_modules, so ci-status.mjs and every module it imports must stay dependency-free (node builtins and repo-local files only); a devDependency import such as the `yaml` package passes local tests but crashes trigger-cd on main with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND, and because trigger-cd is advisory this failure blocks nothing and posts no required-context signal.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.forgejo/workflows/app-ci.yml#L1-L60",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ca4acaa37cd9133aedda82590f637d33e17695a1e60c17bdc32ee4fb94f492fe:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/cd-dispatch-gate.mjs#L1-L39",
